센터 점포 시간은 별도 확인 필요)","holiday":"매월 둘째·넷째 화요일","links":[{"food":"jagalchi-hoe","index":1}]},{"number":42,"name":"쌍둥이돼지국밥","hours":"월~일 09:00–22:00","links":[{"food":"dwaeji-gukbap","index":1}]},{"number":43,"name":"양대감 대구탕","hours":"24시간 영업","links":[{"food":"masan-agujjim","index":0}]},{"number":44,"name":"영도해녀촌","hours":"09:00–19:00 (기상 상황·개별 점포에 따라 변동)","links":[{"food":"yeongdo-jeonbokjuk","index":0}]},{"number":45,"name":"영란 고래고기","hours":"월~일 13:00–23:00","links":[{"food":"gorae-gogi","index":0}]},{"number":46,"name":"옛날통닭","hours":"월·화·수·목·금·토 17:30–다음 날 06:00 / 일 17:30–다음 날 05:00","links":[{"food":"andong-jjimdak","index":1}]},{"number":47,"name":"옥당분식","hours":"확인 필요","holiday":"매주 일요일","links":[{"food":"multteok","index":2}]},{"number":48,"name":"원조 개금밀면","hours":"월~일 11:00–20:00","links":[{"food":"milmyeon","index":2}]},{"number":49,"name":"원조 꼬마김밥","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"multteok","index":3}]},{"number":50,"name":"원조 승기 씨앗호떡","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"ssiat-hotteok","index":0}]},{"number":51,"name":"원조깡통비빔당면","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"bibim-dangmyeon","index":1}]},{"number":52,"name":"원조동래파전","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"dongnae-pajeon","index":1}]},{"number":53,"name":"율선횟집","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"dodari-ssukguk","index":2}]},{"number":54,"name":"자갈치 곰장어","hours":"월~일 13:00–23:00","links":[{"food":"kkomjangeo","index":8}]},{"number":55,"name":"자갈치시장 (활어부·2층 회식당)","hours":"시장 안내 05:00–22:00 (2층 회식당은 점포별 확인 필요)","holiday":"매월 첫째·셋째·다섯째 화요일","links":[{"food":"jagalchi-hoe","index":0}]},{"number":56,"name":"장군멸치회촌","hours":"영업일 09:30–20:00","holiday":"매주 월요일","links":[{"food":"gijang-myeolchi","index":0}]},{"number":57,"name":"정아 밀면 돼지국밥","hours":"월~일 10:00–22:00","links":[{"food":"dwaeji-gukbap","index":6}]},{"number":58,"name":"제이제이가리비 청사포 본점","hours":"일~금 12:00–22:00 / 토 12:00–24:00","links":[{"food":"cheongsapo-jogae","index":3}]},{"number":59,"name":"조개뷰 해운대본점","hours":"일~금 11:30–24:00 (마지막 주문 23:30) / 토 11:30–다음 날 01:00 (마지막 주문 00:30)","links":[{"food":"cheongsapo-jogae","index":2}]},{"number":60,"name":"조방낙지 범일직영점","hours":"월~일 11:00–22:00","links":[{"food":"nakgopsae","index":0},{"food":"jobang-nakji","index":0}]},{"number":61,"name":"조방낙지 주례점","hours":"월~일 10:30–23:00","links":[{"food":"nakgopsae","index":4},{"food":"jobang-nakji","index":5}]},{"number":62,"name":"조은대게","hours":"영업일 09:00–21:00 (마지막 주문 20:30)","links":[{"food":"gijang-daege","index":1}]},{"number":63,"name":"주연네 곰장어","hours":"월~일 11:00–23:30","links":[{"food":"kkomjangeo","index":6}]},{"number":64,"name":"진주냉면 대연본점","hours":"월~일 10:30–20:30","links":[{"food":"jinju-naengmyeon","index":0}]},{"number":65,"name":"진주네 횟집","hours":"월~일 11:00–23:00","links":[{"food":"dodari-ssukguk","index":0}]},{"number":66,"name":"진주비빔밥","hours":"확인 필요","holiday":"매주 토요일·일요일 및 공휴일","links":[{"food":"jinju-bibimbap","index":0}]},{"number":67,"name":"천성중앙횟집","hours":"월·화·수·목 10:00–19:00 / 금 10:00–20:30 / 토·일 10:00–21:30","links":[{"food":"yeongdeok-uljin-daege","index":0}]},{"number":68,"name":"초량밀면","hours":"월~일 10:00–21:30","links":[{"food":"milmyeon","index":7}]},{"number":69,"name":"초원복국 해운대점","hours":"월~일 08:00–21:00","links":[{"food":"bokguk","index":1}]},{"number":70,"name":"충무명물 김밥세상","hours":"월~일 08:00–22:00","links":[{"food":"chungmu-gimbap","index":1}]},{"number":71,"name":"포항물회","hours":"월~일 11:00–21:30","links":[{"food":"pohang-mulhoe","index":0}]},{"number":72,"name":"하기연진주냉면","hours":"확인 필요","holiday":"매주 일요일","links":[{"food":"jinju-naengmyeon","index":1}]},{"number":73,"name":"하동 재첩국","hours":"월~일 05:00–21:00","links":[{"food":"hadong-jaecheopguk","index":3}]},{"number":74,"name":"한양족발","hours":"확인 필요","links":[{"food":"naengchae-jokbal","index":1}]},{"number":75,"name":"할매 충무김밥","hours":"24시간 영업","links":[{"food":"milmyeon","index":4},{"food":"chungmu-gimbap","index":3}]},{"number":76,"name":"할매손 충무김밥","hours":"월·화·수·목·금 09:00–21:00 / 토·일 08:00–21:00","links":[{"food":"chungmu-gimbap","index":4}]},{"number":77,"name":"할매재첩국 부산본점","hours":"월~일 07:00–21:00","links":[{"food":"hadong-jaecheopguk","index":4}]},{"number":78,"name":"해운대가야밀면","hours":"월~일 10:00–20:40","links":[{"food":"milmyeon","index":9}]},{"number":79,"name":"해운대암소갈비집","hours":"월~일 11:30–22:00","links":[{"food":"haeundae-galbi","index":0}]},{"number":80,"name":"해운대이름난암소갈비","hours":"월~일 11:00–23:00","links":[{"food":"haeundae-galbi","index":1}]},{"number":81,"name":"홍소족발","hours":"월·화·수·목·금·토 11:30–23:00 / 일 11:30–22:30","links":[{"food":"naengchae-jokbal","index":5}]}]$operating$::jsonb)
as x(number integer, name text, hours text, holiday text, links jsonb);
create temp table _operating_targets on commit drop as
select distinct i.number,i.name,i.hours,i.holiday,r.id
from _operating_input i
cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(i.links) l
join public.ieb_restaurant r on r.name=i.name
and r.food_links @> jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('food_id',l.value->>'food','place_index',(l.value->>'index')::integer));
do $$ begin
 if (select count(*) from _operating_input)<>81
 or exists(select 1 from _operating_input i left join _operating_targets t using(number) group by i.number having count(t.id)<>1)
 or (select count(distinct id) from _operating_targets)<>81 then
  raise exception 'Expected exactly 81 unambiguous restaurant matches; no data changed';
 end if;
end $$;
create temp table _restaurant_before on commit drop as table public.ieb_restaurant;
create temp table _food_before on commit drop as table public.ieb_foods;
create temp table _expected_foods on commit drop as select id,content from public.ieb_foods;
do $$ declare item record; link jsonb; data jsonb; p jsonb; idx text; begin
 for item in select * from _operating_input order by number loop
  for link in select value from jsonb_array_elements(item.links) loop
   select content into data from _expected_foods where id=link->>'food';
   idx:=link->>'index'; p:=data#>array['places',idx];
   if p is null or p->>'name' is distinct from item.name then
    raise exception 'Food/place identity mismatch for %: %',item.name,link;
   end if;
   p:=jsonb_set(p,'{hours}',to_jsonb(item.hours));
   if item.holiday is not null then p:=jsonb_set(p,'{holiday}',to_jsonb(item.holiday)); end if;
   if jsonb_typeof(p->'research')='object' then
    p:=jsonb_set(p,'{research,hours}',to_jsonb(item.hours));
    if item.holiday is not null then p:=jsonb_set(p,'{research,holiday}',to_jsonb(item.holiday)); end if;
   end if;
   data:=jsonb_set(data,array['places',idx],p);
   update _expected_foods set content=data where id=link->>'food';
  end loop;
 end loop;
end $$;
update public.ieb_restaurant r set opening_hours=t.hours,closed_days=coalesce(t.holiday,r.closed_days)
from _operating_targets t where r.id=t.id
and (r.opening_hours is distinct from t.hours or r.closed_days is distinct from coalesce(t.holiday,r.closed_days));
update public.ieb_foods f set content=e.content from _expected_foods e
where f.id=e.id and f.content is distinct from e.content;
do $$ begin
 if exists(select 1 from public.ieb_restaurant r join _restaurant_before b using(id)
 where to_jsonb(r)-array['opening_hours','closed_days','updated_at'] is distinct from to_jsonb(b)-array['opening_hours','closed_days','updated_at'])
 or exists(select 1 from public.ieb_restaurant r join _restaurant_before b using(id)
 where (r.opening_hours,r.closed_days) is distinct from (b.opening_hours,b.closed_days)
 and r.id not in(select id from _operating_targets))
 or exists(select 1 from public.ieb_foods f join _food_before b using(id)
 where to_jsonb(f)-array['content','updated_at'] is distinct from to_jsonb(b)-array['content','updated_at'])
 or exists(select 1 from public.ieb_foods f join _expected_foods e using(id) where f.content is distinct from e.content)
 then raise exception 'Out-of-scope data change; transaction rolled back'; end if;
end $$;
select jsonb_build_object('matched_restaurants',(select count(*) from _operating_targets),'food_place_links',(select sum(jsonb_array_length(links)) from _operating_input),'changed_restaurants',(select count(*) from public.ieb_restaurant r join _restaurant_before b using(id) where (r.opening_hours,r.closed_days) is distinct from (b.opening_hours,b.closed_days)),'changed_foods',(select count(*) from public.ieb_foods f join _food_before b using(id) where f.content is distinct from b.content),'out_of_scope_changes',0) as operating_information_result;
commit;
